# The platform a build signs in to by default (copy to platform.properties, git-ignored).
# The sign-in screen starts on these three addresses; « Autre plateforme » still lets a person
# type others. Without this file (or the PLATFORM_*_URL environment variables) the screen asks.
engineUrl=https://agent.example.com
schedulerUrl=https://sched.example.com
portalUrl=https://auth.example.com
